# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# InfraImpact - repository hygiene
#
# Layout this file assumes:
#   live_feeds/    captured snapshots of the ~46 live regional signals
#   collectors/    scripts that re-fetch live_feeds/ and the datasets
#   data/          regional + research datasets (regional/, reference/, research/)
#   src/ llm/ tests/   source
#   unused/        superseded prior work, parked and not tracked
#
# Bulk payloads are NOT tracked: they are large (order 1 GB) and fully
# reproducible. Re-fetch with:
#     python collectors/download_all_sources_extended.py
# What every ignored payload contains, and where it belongs, is documented in
# data/README.md. Structure, docs and the collectors themselves ARE tracked.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# --- Python ---
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
build/
dist/
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.coverage
htmlcov/

# --- Virtualenvs ---
# .venv/ is this project's interpreter; unused/.venv is a stale copy from an
# earlier workspace and is parked under unused/ as well.
.venv/
venv/

# --- Secrets ---
# llm/.env holds a real OpenRouter key. Only .env.example may be tracked.
.env
.env.local
!.env.example

# --- Local databases (regenerated by `infraimpact run`) ---
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3

# --- Live signal snapshots ---
# 46 files, ~10 MB. Refreshed in place by the collectors.
live_feeds/

# --- Regional datasets ---
data/raw/
data/regional/
data/reference/
data/research/

# --- Scratch / prior work ---
scratch/
unused/
transit_gtfs/
infrastructure_gis/
run-markdown-file-at-start.json
smoke.py
api_check.py

# --- Editor / OS ---
.vscode/
.idea/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
